content.text:
Now mobile overrides. Need locate sections.

At @media max-width 860, #hand margin -30. Change maybe -14. At 760, hand grid. We'll rewrite mobile dock block.

Current 760 block:
```
.combat-dock { display:grid; grid-template-columns:auto minmax(0,1fr) auto; align-items:end; gap:2; padding...}
.energy-orb { grid-column:1; grid-row:1; align-self:end; width46... margin-bottom:14}
.hand-wrap { grid-column:2; grid-row:1; ...}
.hand {...}
#hand .card + .card { margin-left:-26px;}
.end-turn-wrap { grid-column:3; grid-row:1; padding-bottom:14px;}
```
Replace with:
```
.combat-dock { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr; grid-template-rows:auto auto; align-items:end; gap:0; padding:0 4px max(6px...);}
.hand-wrap{grid-column:1;grid-row:1;justify-content:flex-start;overflow-x:auto;padding:0 4px;}
.hand{justify-content:flex-start; min-height: calc(var(--card-h)+10px); padding:12px 2px 0;}
#hand .card + .card {margin-left:-12px;}
.energy-orb{position:absolute?}
.end-turn-wrap{grid-column:1;grid-row:2;display:flex;flex-direction:row;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;width:100%;padding:2px 4px 0;}
```
But energy orb needs be in bottom row left. We can put energy orb also in row2 but end-turn-wrap only one grid cell. Could set `.combat-dock` three columns in row2? Simpler positions:
```
.combat-dock { grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; grid-template-rows:auto auto; }
.hand-wrap { grid-column:1/-1; grid-row:1; }
.energy-orb { grid-column:1; grid-row:2; justify-self:start; ...}
.end-turn-wrap { grid-column:2; grid-row:2; justify-self:end; }
```
This is good. Hand full width (minus dock padding); 5 cards total 382. Energy orb 46 in row2 left, end turn right. Row2 height ~46. Dock total card 138+10+46 = 194. On 844, arena 650? Previously dock 164; new 194, arena reduces to 610, okay.

Set align-items:center in arena mobile. Also set combatant widths and art.

```
.arena {align-items:center;}
.combatant{width:min(42vw,178px)}
.enemy{width:min(43vw,182px)}
.combatant-art{max-height:26vh}
```
The zones row remaining after center ~ arena height - banner ~ 40; gives 570; combatant 178 + plate 80 = 258, centered => good, big gap still but balanced (from 120 to 500). Hmm no huge empty gap. Moon at top 9% ~ y100, height 110. Center banner at top of arena y maybe 40. Moon behind. combatants y~ 280-540. Cards start 650. Good.

Set `.combat-moon` smaller 100. Could add.

Also HUD: on mobile `combat-screen` rows auto 1fr auto auto; hand dock 194 + hud 46 => arena 604. Fine.

Let's edit.

